## Emits an INFO level message using a target logger instance.
##
## ### Parameters
## - `l`: Target `AppLogger` instance.
## - `msg`: Message value.
##
## ### Returns
## `1` when emitted, `0` when filtered out.
pub function info(l: AppLogger, msg) -> int return logger_info(l, msg) end
## Emits a WARN level message using a target logger instance.
##
## ### Parameters
## - `l`: Target `AppLogger` instance.
## - `msg`: Message value.
##
## ### Returns
## `1` when emitted, `0` when filtered out.
pub function warn(l: AppLogger, msg) -> int return logger_warn(l, msg) end
